<title>USA: ValuJet June load factor 53.0 pct vs 40.2.</title>
<headline>ValuJet June load factor 53.0 pct vs 40.2.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monthly Results, June</p>
<p>				    1997	     1996	 percent</p>
<p>    Enplaned Passengers    267,404	  96,520</p>
<p>    RPMs (000)		 135,076	  49,626</p>
<p>    ASMs (000)		 254,963	 123,570</p>
<p>    System Load Factor	  53.0	    40.2    +12.8 pts.</p>
<p>				   Quarterly Results</p>
<p>				   2Q 1997	 2Q 1996	 Percent</p>
<p>    Enplaned Passengers    766,956     1,056,580</p>
<p>    RPMs (000)		 384,926	 545,882</p>
<p>    ASMs (000)		 700,745	 980,282</p>
<p>    System Load Factor	  54.9%	   55.7%   (0.8) pts.</p>
<p>NOTE:  ValuJet Airlines operated through June 17, 1996.</p>
<p>Full co name is ValuJet Airlines, Inc.</p>
</text>
